  vendorName: Auditor Sterling
  offerText: I am seizing your incredibly soft, oversized lounge chair to settle
    a minor tax discrepancy. It will leave your room barren and your heart heavy.
  acceptResultText: Sterling hauls your favorite chair away. You feel miserable,
    but forced to stand and stretch, your chronic back pain miraculously disappears!
  rejectResultText: You lock the door and refuse to let him take it. You sink into
    the soft chair, feeling happy...
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: ...but maintaining your terrible posture.
